ONextBox adapts the bottom-tab, profile-page, download-cleanup, AI Vision,
advertising SDK and search purification hooks from this project.
The adapted implementation is in BrowserPurifyHooker.kt and BrowserPurifyRules.kt.
Changes: Kotlin and Modern Xposed API integration; ONextBox configuration, hot
reload and COUI controls; support for browser 40.10.24.1 interfaces; independent
badge/reward controls; native search initialization retained; no persistent
override of the browser's saved default-tab preference.

The original MIT copyright and permission notice remain applicable to the
adapted portions. ONextBox's other code retains its existing license.
